Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-10-09 05:47:14 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:02,580] | Words: 10 | Text: 你有没有发现身体明明躺着
Segment #2   [00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:04,060] | Words: 9  | Text: 心却像跑了长马拉松
Segment #3   [00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,860] | Words: 8  | Text: 让你累的不是生活本身
Segment #4   [00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:08,580] | Words: 14 | Text: 而是你脑子里那场停不下来的戏
Segment #5   [00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,540] | Words: 10 | Text: 我发现现代人最大的通病
Segment #6   [00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,100] | Words: 12 | Text: 思绪过生胡思乱想过渡脑补
Segment #7   [00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,280] | Words: 5  | Text: 事情还没发生
Segment #8   [00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,700] | Words: 8  | Text: 脑补一万种坏结果
Segment #9   [00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:16,960] | Words: 7  | Text: 别人随口一句话
Segment #10  [00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,380] | Words: 9  | Text: 反复传模整夜睡不着
Segment #11  [00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:19,860] | Words: 7  | Text: 一点小时无限放大
Segment #12  [00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,040] | Words: 5  | Text: 越想越焦虑
Segment #13  [00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:21,960] | Words: 5  | Text: 越想越难过
Segment #14  [00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,000] | Words: 5  | Text: 越想越内耗
Segment #15  [00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,240] | Words: 6  | Text: 很多人身体不累
Segment #16  [00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,380] | Words: 6  | Text: 心活得特别累
Segment #17  [00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:26,580] | Words: 4  | Text: 所有的反脑
Segment #18  [00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:27,300] | Words: 2  | Text: 焦虑
Segment #19  [00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:27,960] | Words: 2  | Text: 失眠
Segment #20  [00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:28,660] | Words: 2  | Text: 压抑
Segment #21  [00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:29,380] | Words: 3  | Text: 不快乐
Segment #22  [00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:31,020] | Words: 8  | Text: 根源只有一个任志漏洞
Segment #23  [00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:31,880] | Words: 4  | Text: 过渡思绪
Segment #24  [00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:35,040] | Words: 12 | Text: 我讲透一个99%的人都不知道的真相
Segment #25  [00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:36,840] | Words: 7  | Text: 人生90%你担忧
Segment #26  [00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:37,440] | Words: 2  | Text: 焦虑
Segment #27  [00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,200] | Words: 3  | Text: 害怕的是
Segment #28  [00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,620] | Words: 7  | Text: 最后根本不会发生
Segment #29  [00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:40,680] | Words: 3  | Text: 你的痛苦
Segment #30  [00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,120] | Words: 6  | Text: 全部来自你的想象
Segment #31  [00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:43,160] | Words: 5  | Text: 不是现实本身
Segment #32  [00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,400] | Words: 4  | Text: 低任志的人
Segment #33  [00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,760] | Words: 8  | Text: 永远活在未来焦虑
Segment #34  [00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:46,700] | Words: 6  | Text: 和过去遗憾里
Segment #35  [00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,000] | Words: 6  | Text: 纠结已经过去的是
Segment #36  [00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,320] | Words: 7  | Text: 担忧还没到来的是
Segment #37  [00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,940] | Words: 9  | Text: 穿摩无关紧要的人何事
Segment #38  [00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:52,240] | Words: 7  | Text: 大脑永远在空转
Segment #39  [00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,120] | Words: 5  | Text: 永远在消耗
Segment #40  [00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,300] | Words: 7  | Text: 永远在胡思乱想
Segment #41  [00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,760] | Words: 7  | Text: 唯独没有活在当下
Segment #42  [00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:56,860] | Words: 5  | Text: 没有专注眼前
Segment #43  [00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:58,340] | Words: 6  | Text: 高任志通透的人
Segment #44  [00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,920] | Words: 9  | Text: 早就借掉了过渡思绪
Segment #45  [00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:00,920] | Words: 5  | Text: 往事不回头
Segment #46  [00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:01,920] | Words: 5  | Text: 未来不将久
Segment #47  [00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:02,840] | Words: 5  | Text: 当下的内号
Segment #48  [00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,820] | Words: 3  | Text: 过去的是
Segment #49  [00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:04,820] | Words: 5  | Text: 已经承爱落定
Segment #50  [00:01:04,820 --> 00:01:05,600] | Words: 4  | Text: 纠结无用
Segment #51  [00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:06,480] | Words: 4  | Text: 后悔无用
Segment #52  [00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,440] | Words: 4  | Text: 内号无用
Segment #53  [00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,300] | Words: 4  | Text: 不如放下
Segment #54  [00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:09,100] | Words: 3  | Text: 未来的是
Segment #55  [00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,260] | Words: 6  | Text: 充满未知变数
Segment #56  [00:01:10,260 --> 00:01:11,160] | Words: 4  | Text: 焦虑无用
Segment #57  [00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:11,980] | Words: 4  | Text: 脑补无用
Segment #58  [00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:12,800] | Words: 4  | Text: 担忧无用
Segment #59  [00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:13,460] | Words: 4  | Text: 不如从容
Segment #60  [00:01:13,460 --> 00:01:14,560] | Words: 3  | Text: 当下的是
Segment #61  [00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:15,580] | Words: 5  | Text: 他他是是做好
Segment #62  [00:01:15,580 --> 00:01:16,760] | Words: 6  | Text: 任人真真活好
Segment #63  [00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,900] | Words: 6  | Text: 安安稳稳过好
Segment #64  [00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:18,800] | Words: 4  | Text: 才最真实
Segment #65  [00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:19,920] | Words: 4  | Text: 我教大家一个
Segment #66  [00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:20,540] | Words: 3  | Text: 最简单
Segment #67  [00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:21,800] | Words: 8  | Text: 最顶级的任志心态
Segment #68  [00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:22,800] | Words: 4  | Text: 大事看待
Segment #69  [00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:23,700] | Words: 4  | Text: 小事看开
Segment #70  [00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:25,020] | Words: 7  | Text: 无视不胡思乱想
Segment #71  [00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:26,160] | Words: 4  | Text: 能解决的是
Segment #72  [00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:26,960] | Words: 4  | Text: 不必焦虑
Segment #73  [00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:27,960] | Words: 4  | Text: 不能解决的是
Segment #74  [00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:28,740] | Words: 4  | Text: 不必担忧
Segment #75  [00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:29,840] | Words: 5  | Text: 不要传络人心
Segment #76  [00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:30,920] | Words: 5  | Text: 不要猜测结果
Segment #77  [00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,120] | Words: 5  | Text: 不要过渡脑补
Segment #78  [00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,080] | Words: 5  | Text: 不要自我承诺
Segment #79  [00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,180] | Words: 5  | Text: 人生本不累
Segment #80  [00:01:34,180 --> 00:01:35,380] | Words: 6  | Text: 是你的思绪太重
Segment #81  [00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:36,240] | Words: 4  | Text: 心思太惜
Segment #82  [00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:37,040] | Words: 4  | Text: 直念太深
Segment #83  [00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:37,800] | Words: 4  | Text: 活得太累
Segment #84  [00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:39,400] | Words: 7  | Text: 慢慢修炼自己的内心
Segment #85  [00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,340] | Words: 3  | Text: 心大一点
Segment #86  [00:01:40,340 --> 00:01:41,120] | Words: 3  | Text: 是小一点
Segment #87  [00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,000] | Words: 3  | Text: 简单一点
Segment #88  [00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:42,820] | Words: 3  | Text: 通透一点
Segment #89  [00:01:42,820 --> 00:01:43,740] | Words: 3  | Text: 该吃吃
Segment #90  [00:01:43,740 --> 00:01:44,460] | Words: 3  | Text: 该做做
Segment #91  [00:01:44,460 --> 00:01:45,200] | Words: 3  | Text: 该放放
Segment #92  [00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,080] | Words: 3  | Text: 该挺挺
Segment #93  [00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:47,500] | Words: 6  | Text: 轻轰多于思绪
Segment #94  [00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:48,680] | Words: 6  | Text: 放下无位直念
Segment #95  [00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:50,620] | Words: 8  | Text: 人生瞬间轻松通透
Segment #96  [00:01:50,620 --> 00:01:52,160] | Words: 6  | Text: 人间最好的状态
Segment #97  [00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:53,060] | Words: 4  | Text: 心无宅念
Segment #98  [00:01:53,060 --> 00:01:53,900] | Words: 4  | Text: 于是不荒
Segment #99  [00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:54,740] | Words: 4  | Text: 过往不练
Segment #100 [00:01:54,740 --> 00:01:55,560] | Words: 4  | Text: 未来不赢
Segment #101 [00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,500] | Words: 4  | Text: 当下不复
Segment #102 [00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:57,520] | Words: 3  | Text: 心简单
Segment #103 [00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:58,420] | Words: 4  | Text: 是就简单
Segment #104 [00:01:58,420 --> 00:01:59,140] | Words: 3  | Text: 心通透
Segment #105 [00:01:59,140 --> 00:02:00,040] | Words: 4  | Text: 路就顺畅
